9\">तू <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"00:57.039\" end=\"00:57.423\">कभी <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"00:57.423\" end=\"00:58.080\">रू-ब-रू<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"00:58.080\" end=\"01:03.050\">\n        <span begin=\"00:58.080\" end=\"00:58.844\">शोर-शराबा <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"00:58.844\" end=\"00:59.226\">जो <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"00:59.226\" end=\"00:59.672\">सीने <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"00:59.672\" end=\"01:00.086\">में <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:00.086\" end=\"01:00.468\">है <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:00.468\" end=\"01:01.105\">मेरे, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:01.105\" end=\"01:01.551\">कैसे <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:01.551\" end=\"01:01.997\">बयाँ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:01.997\" end=\"01:02.411\">मैं <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:02.411\" end=\"01:03.050\">करूँ?<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:03.050\" end=\"01:07.030\">\n        <span begin=\"01:03.050\" end=\"01:03.496\">हाल <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:03.496\" end=\"01:03.907\">जो <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:03.907\" end=\"01:04.387\">मेरा <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:04.387\" end=\"01:05.004\">है, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:05.004\" end=\"01:05.450\">मैं <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:05.450\" end=\"01:05.896\">किस <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:05.896\" end=\"01:06.307\">को <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:06.307\" end=\"01:07.030\">बताऊँ?<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:07.030\" end=\"01:13.510\">\n        <span begin=\"01:07.030\" end=\"01:07.642\">मेरे <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:07.642\" end=\"01:08.605\">साहिबा, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:08.605\" end=\"01:09.174\">दिल <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:09.174\" end=\"01:09.699\">ना <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:09.699\" end=\"01:10.355\">किराए <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:10.355\" end=\"01:11.143\">का, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:11.143\" end=\"01:11.755\">थोड़ा <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:11.755\" end=\"01:12.280\">तो <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:12.280\" end=\"01:12.980\">सँभालो <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:12.980\" end=\"01:13.510\">ना<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:13.510\" end=\"01:17.320\">\n        <span begin=\"01:13.510\" end=\"01:14.227\">नाज़ुक <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:14.227\" end=\"01:14.764\">है <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:14.764\" end=\"01:15.570\">ये, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:15.570\" end=\"01:16.152\">टूट <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:16.152\" end=\"01:16.779\">जाता <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:16.779\" end=\"01:17.320\">है<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:17.320\" end=\"01:23.390\">\n        <span begin=\"01:17.320\" end=\"01:18.316\">साहिबा, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:18.316\" end=\"01:19.584\">नींदें-वींदें <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:19.584\" end=\"01:20.127\">आए <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:20.127\" end=\"01:20.942\">ना, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:20.942\" end=\"01:21.621\">रातें <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:21.621\" end=\"01:22.255\">काटी <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:22.255\" end=\"01:22.843\">जाए <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:22.843\" end=\"01:23.390\">ना<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:23.390\" end=\"01:50.970\">\n        <span begin=\"01:23.390\" end=\"01:27.828\">तेरा <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:27.828\" end=\"01:31.632\">ही <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:31.632\" end=\"01:36.070\">ख़याल <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:36.070\" end=\"01:43.044\">दिन-रैन <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:43.044\" end=\"01:47.165\">आता <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:47.165\" end=\"01:50.970\">है<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:50.970\" end=\"02:00.450\">\n        <span begin=\"01:50.970\" end=\"01:51.945\">कैसी <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:51.945\" end=\"01:52.851\">भला <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:52.851\" end=\"01:53.687\">शब <\/span>\n        <spa